  "_doc": "Colors are Endesga 32 palette indexes. accent = [dark, mid, light] tints tiles, sky and creatures. The first planet is the default start. intro: 'scan' (the homeworld's opening: Thales finishes copying himself and wakes you, src/data/homeworld.json), 'wake' (a cradle opens; no world uses it since the Metanoia story, 2026-10-26) or 'land' (the ship descends). ground = [dark, base, speckle] floor colors (default [25, 24, 23]). dayCycle: lighting follows the device clock (src/data/daycycle.json). weather: real-hour rain. ponds: number of ponds. flowers: chance per open tile. wildlife: peaceful creatures (grazers can be petted). poles: polar caps seen from orbit (size 0..1 from equator to pole, [edge, core] palette colors); leave out for none. shy: the world's creatures never attack; they flee from you (Earth is peaceful: humanity is gone, nature took the ruins back). On every world creatures leave you alone in the town (enemies.json townSafe). gravity: surface gravity in Earth g (heavier worlds shorten the dash, make dust fall faster and landings heavier). sunTint: multiplies the day cycle's light and sky (a red dwarf's dim red day).",
